      "display_text": "我最先记住的，\n是她的笑。"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "title": "02 · 先吃这一口",
      "text": "家里常有人等着喝药。我等着吃饭。",
      "source": "00_Doc/美术/序章绘本/storyboard/scene-02.png",
      "runtime": "picture_books/prologue/images/scene-02.png",
