      "read_hold_seconds": 7.0,
      "entrance_seconds": 0.9,
      "display_text": "家里常有人\n等着喝药。\n我等着吃饭。"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "title": "03 · 门边的小观察者",
      "text": "原来大人有时候也要人喂。",
      "source": "00_Doc/美术/序章绘本/storyboard/scene-03.png",
      "runtime": "picture_books/prologue/images/scene-03.png",
      "sha256": "28fbafd4b0c69bd77c7a423f763846a73a760534c5d7d81315594272cc1289ee",
      "read_hold_seconds": 7.0,
      "entrance_seconds": 0.9,
      "display_text": "原来大人有时候\n也要人喂。"
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "title": "04 · 动静倒不小",
      "text": "我也试了一次。药没配好，动静倒不小。",
      "source": "00_Doc/美术/序章绘本/storyboard/scene-04.png",
      "runtime": "picture_books/prologue/images/scene-04.png",
      "sha256": "71f167c2df9d06db8bdb7de0ba875dfc67b38c272b8abe07b16b32b3dd568336",
      "read_hold_seconds": 8.0,
      "entrance_seconds": 0.9,
      "display_text": "我也试了一次。\n药没配好，\n动静倒不小。"
    },
    {
      "page": 5,
      "title": "05 · 一起蹲下来",
      "text": "后来，她教我先认清锅里放的是什么。",
      "source": "00_Doc/美术/序章绘本/storyboard/scene-05.png",
      "runtime": "picture_books/prologue/images/scene-05.png",
      "sha256": "ce51d9f13256e0af88f442ad6c1f87f9e210dc2f17c1f55d06b694ce1a619d18",
      "read_hold_seconds": 7.0,
      "entrance_seconds": 0.9,
      "display_text": "后来，她教我\n先认清锅里\n放的是什么。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "title": "06 · 集市里的小声音",
      "text": "有些人叫她魔女。我还是叫她妈妈。",
      "source": "00_Doc/美术/序章绘本/storyboard/scene-06.png",
      "runtime": "picture_books/prologue/images/scene-06.png",
      "sha256": "da02c3d1b5cf304a2a90dcd23a2b6ccf0543d04e6a166c03fc684830f1ffad83",
      "read_hold_seconds": 7.0,
      "entrance_seconds": 0.9,
      "display_text": "有些人叫她魔女。\n我还是叫她妈妈。"
    },
    {
      "page": 7,
      "title": "07 · 那晚还没睡",
      "text": "那晚她还没睡。我以为她明天会晚一点起床。",
